{
  "title": "JOIN MILLIONS WHO DITCHED PLASTIC FOR GOOD",
  "sectionHTML": "<section class=\"pfrv\" id=\"pfrv-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" aria-label=\"Customer reviews and stories\" data-pfrv-init=\"1\"><div class=\"pfrv-heading-wrap wrap\">\n      <h2>Join millions who ditched plastic for good</h2>\n    </div><div class=\"p-reviews\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Review categories\"><button class=\"tab active\" type=\"button\" data-tab=\"microplastic-free\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-microplastic-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" aria-controls=\"panel-microplastic-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">\n                Microplastic-free\n              </button><button class=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-tab=\"mold-free\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-mold-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" aria-controls=\"panel-mold-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n                Mold-free\n              </button><button class=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-tab=\"glue-free\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-glue-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" aria-controls=\"panel-glue-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n                Glue-free\n              </button><button class=\"tab\" type=\"button\" data-tab=\"firm-clean\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-firm-clean-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" aria-controls=\"panel-firm-clean-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n                Firm clean\n              </button></div><div class=\"panel active\" data-panel=\"microplastic-free\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-microplastic-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"panel-microplastic-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\">\n            <div class=\"rcards\"><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>Plastic out of my routine</h3><p>The thought of scrubbing synthetic bristles across my teeth twice a day put me off. Real boar bristle means nothing plastic in my routine.</p><div class=\"rname\">DION R.</div></div><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>Real bristle, nothing fake</h3><p>I wanted a brush that wasn't made of plastic from tip to handle. Bamboo and boar bristle, that's the whole thing, and that's the point.</p><div class=\"rname\">KAI M.</div></div><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>No synthetic anything</h3><p>Made the switch to get plastic out of my body where I could. Starting with the brush I use twice a day felt like the obvious first move.</p><div class=\"rname\">SERENA P.</div></div></div>\n          </div><div class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"mold-free\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-mold-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"panel-mold-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\">\n            <div class=\"rcards\"><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>Actually dries between brushes</h3><p>My plastic brush sat damp in a cup and got gross. This one stands on its own base, so it air-dries and never stays wet.</p><div class=\"rname\">TOMAS H.</div></div><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>Stands up, stays clean</h3><p>Love that it dries upright instead of face-down in a holder. No pooled water, no funk, it looks and smells clean every morning.</p><div class=\"rname\">NADINE V.</div></div><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>No more grimy handle</h3><p>Old brushes always built up gunk where they sat. This one dries out fully on its own stand, so nothing has a chance to grow on it.</p><div class=\"rname\">ELLIOT B.</div></div></div>\n          </div><div class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"glue-free\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-glue-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"panel-glue-free-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\">\n            <div class=\"rcards\"><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>No glued-in tufts</h3><p>Most brushes anchor the bristles in glue that breaks down and traps residue. These are woven in without any, which is what sold me.</p><div class=\"rname\">HARPER S.</div></div><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>Held together with no shedding</h3><p>Cheap brushes drop bristles once the adhesive gives out. Woven construction means mine has stayed solid the whole time I've had it.</p><div class=\"rname\">RENZO A.</div></div><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>Just wood and bristle</h3><p>No glue, no plastic weld, nothing extra in the base. Simple honest materials I don't mind putting in my mouth every day.</p><div class=\"rname\">CAMILA G.</div></div></div>\n          </div><div class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"firm-clean\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-firm-clean-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"panel-firm-clean-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\">\n            <div class=\"rcards\"><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>Cleanest my teeth have felt</h3><p>The boar bristle has real firmness to it, so it actually cleans. My teeth feel smooth and polished after every single brush.</p><div class=\"rname\">COLE R.</div></div><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>Thorough without feeling harsh</h3><p>Firm enough for a proper deep clean, but it doesn't tear up my gums. Exactly the balance I was looking for in a natural brush.</p><div class=\"rname\">Sophia D.</div></div><div class=\"rcard\">\n                      <div class=\"rstars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span></div><h3>My teeth feel properly clean</h3><p>There's enough firmness in these bristles to do the job right. My mouth feels genuinely clean now, not just freshened up.</p><div class=\"rname\">Stephany M.</div></div></div>\n          </div></div>\n    </div><div class=\"pfvc\">\n        <div class=\"pfvc-scroller\">\n          <button class=\"pfvc-arrow pfvc-arrow--prev\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous video testimonial\" aria-controls=\"pfvc-track-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" disabled=\"\" style=\"display: flex;\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n              <path d=\"M15 5l-7 7 7 7\"></path>\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n\n          <div class=\"pfvc-track\" id=\"pfvc-track-template--21310525931820__testimonial_section_pHTt9Q\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Video testimonials\" tabindex=\"0\"><article class=\"pfvc-card is-paused\" data-pfvc-name=\"\"><video muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsinline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"//primals.shop/cdn/shop/files/1_1.png?v=1789989487&amp;width=600\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/a72691c6643f4986ab65a7ef85fef43d.mp4\"></video>\n   